 CTG 450->900 delta+450; VCB 450->900 delta+450), UNAVAILABLE 3/6 (BID/NCT/SAB — ky bao cao quy gan nhat NAM TRUOC ex-date, do tre theo quy), MISMATCH 0. Xac nhan dung canh bao cua Mike: tang nay CHAM va KHONG BAO GIO duoc ghi de tang 2 (no la tong TRAILING nen delta co the AM khi co tuc cu roi khoi cua so 1 nam — vd SAB 5000->2000 = -3000, khong lien quan co tuc moi).", "2_bug_that_bat_duoc_khi_chay": "(1) Cua so 2 ngay lam 1 su kien bi dem O CA HAI ngay: ex-date NCT (27/07) TRUNG ngay-cuoi-con-quyen cua SAB (27/07) => NCT bi cong vao ca delta 24/07 lan 3.300.000 cua 27/07 => he mau thuan, HONG CA HAI ma. Fix: moi su kien chi duoc gan vao DUNG MOT ngay (som nhat co delta duong). (2) bq --format=json tra MOI gia tri duoi dang STRING — crash ValueError khi format .0f, bat duoc ngay lan chay that dau tien.", "selfcheck": "25/25 PASS offline (khong can BQ/log), chay lai duoi env -u TZ va TZ=America/New_York deu 25/25. End-to-end that voi BQ+log broker: 6/6 CASH_[REDACTED]D.", "trang_thai": "Code STAGED tai mike/agents/Taylor/exp_div_broker_solve/ — CHUA merge vao mike/bin/dividend_adjusted_return.py vi Winston_20260802_082040 dang sua cung file (collision, da bao o event status truoc)."}
